Z||000000||BAM-BAM||05-06-2001||04:02 PM||||  Has there been any feedback on the OutLaw Performance products?? I really want some of the things they offer and have heard that some here have bought from them. I know they are new and that there may be shipping issues. I just want to know about fitment and finish. TIA <P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||7
Z||000001||pherder||05-06-2001||06:00 PM||||I got one of their trailer hitches thru an eBay auction.<P>It doesn't come close to fitting.  Had to <B>BEND</B> the two sides ~1" each to get it close.  (i.e. it came 37.75" hole to hole and needs to be 39.75")<P>On one of the Fiero email lists, we have found that there is at least 2 others with the same problem.<P>If this is their normal quality  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">, I am <B>NOT</B> going to get any of their other stuff.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>Paul<p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 05-06-2001).]||||reg||13
