Z||000003||BAM-BAM||05-06-2001||09:08 PM|||| I found this about the hitch!! <P><BR>KissMySSFiero<BR>Member <BR>Posts: 240<BR>From:Porter/Chesterton, IN USA<BR>Registered: Nov 2000 <BR>  posted 03-25-2001 01:46 PM                 <BR>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------<BR>hey i got the hitch they sell. worked great..but even better was there service. i needed it fast. like 4 days fast. so i overnighted the payment and they overnighted the hitch. they had to make it right there when i ordered. if i liked scoops i would buy from them. however if i ever get a gt i would get there front spoiler i lke that one. <BR>definite thumbs up company!!!<BR>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:KissMySSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>KissMySSFiero@netzero.net <P> <BR>"There's a fine line between love and beer"<BR> ||||reg||1
